ios.desc:
A simple, reliable tool for selecting colors and checking accessibility compliance. Designed for designers, developers, and accessibility advocates who need accurate results without extra complexity.

// Color Picker //

Fine-tune colors using RGB, HSL, HCT, LCH, or LAB sliders for precise color selection.

// Contrast Checking //

Instantly verify WCAG contrast ratios with detailed AA/AAA compliance results, visual ratio scaling, and suggestions for accessible alternatives.

// Color Blindness Preview //

See how your color pairs appear to individuals with different types of color vision deficiencies.

// Palette Management //

Save, organize, and reuse color palettes. The app also keeps a history of recent color pairs so you never lose track.

// Import and Export //

Bring in palettes from text, files, or images. Export to multiple formats for easy sharing across tools and teams.

// Integration// 

Copy colors to your clipboard, share palettes, and work seamlessly across light and dark themes.

Practical, accurate, and easy to use — everything you need to make confident, accessible color choices.

